{"id":"hsbx4mf8x2tkynkh9p5i3e0h9","title":"东京大学与欧洲同步辐射装置合作实现超短X射线脉冲聚焦的世界纪录","originalTitle":"Scientists squeeze record-breaking X-ray power into an incredibly tiny spot","summary":"东京大学与欧洲同步辐射装置合作，在Optica发表研究，首次实现波长为硬X射线的300飞秒超短脉冲聚焦至180×330纳米区域，强度达10²⁰瓦/平方厘米。铜原子实验证实脉冲强度超过10²⁰瓦/平方厘米，并观测到受激发射（ASE）现象。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261104012329.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T03:46:51.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:32.281Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T03:46:51.000Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["研究成果","超导"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}